#MDRenderer Settings
# 计算规律及答案 — 基线数据（随源码分发，可直接编辑）
# Calculation rules and answers — baseline data shipped with the source
#
# 格式 / Format: TMMF, one `expression=answer` per line, `#` starts a comment.
# 键已归一化 / Keys are normalized: no spaces, lowercase, ASCII operators
# (× ÷ − become * / -, full-width characters become ASCII, trailing "=" dropped).
# 运行时学到的结果写入 calc_memo.user.tmmf / Runtime answers go to calc_memo.user.tmmf.

meta.name=calculation-rules-and-answers
meta.name.zh=计算规律及答案
meta.name.en=Calculation rules and answers
meta.version=1
meta.updated=2026-11-18
meta.kind=baseline

